  - exists (4 * j + 9), (cden [] [] j BB1_0RB1LC_1LC0RD_1LA0LA_1LA1RD).
    split; [lia|]. split; [| exact (gbo_0RB1LC_1LC0RD_1LA0LA_1LA1RD j)].
    rewrite (gso_0RB1LC_1LC0RD_1LA0LA_1LA1RD p j E).
